                    <div class="curriculum-info-card">
                        <h2 class="curriculum-title">Design-Centric Curriculum</h2>
                        <p class="curriculum-text">
                            Industry 4.0 revolutionizes global design, business, management, and engineering education.
                            It demands engineers of the 21st century to possess a holistic understanding of engineering
                            design, manufacturing, and IT integration.
                        </p>
                        <p class="curriculum-text">
                            Meeting current industrial standards and consumer expectations requires products that are
                            easy to manufacture, cost-effective, and user-centric. To address these needs,
                            <strong>Design</strong> is a core element of our institute's vision of <em>'Design, Create,
                                and Innovate'</em>.
                        </p>
                        <p class="curriculum-text">
                            Our students develop unique skills through three-semester-long product design projects,
                            mirroring real-world workflows that encourage collaboration, innovation, and creativity.
                        </p>
                    </div>
